  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "Normal vector of the plane will be<p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mtable><mtr><mtd><mover><mi>i</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></mtd><mtd><mover><mi>j</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></mtd><mtd><mover><mi>k</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>3</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd><mtd><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>2</mn></mtd><mtd><mo>-</mo><mn>5</mn></mtd><mtd><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>11</mn><mover><mi>i</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>-</mo><mover><mi>j</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>-</mo><mn>17</mn><mover><mi>k</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></math></p><p>So, the direction ratios&nbsp;of normal to the required plane are&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mn>11</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>17</mn></mrow></mfenced></math>&nbsp;and plane passes through <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfenced></math>. So, the equation&nbsp;of plane is</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>11</mn><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mfenced><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mn>17</mn><mfenced><mrow><mi>z</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>11</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>17</mn><mi>z</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>38</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p>",
